  "bundles_note": "The levels of detail do not only differ in the number of streamlines but also in the set of bundles: xtract_tiny has 37, xtract_small and xtract_medium have 40 and xtract_large has 42 bundles (SLF1_L and Cing_PeriGen_L are only present in xtract_large).",
  "coordinate_space_note": "The TRK files store their coordinates in a 1mm voxel grid (voxel_order LPS) with a non-identity vox_to_ras matrix; without applying it, the coordinates are in a mirrored (left-right and anterior-posterior flipped) space. freesurferformats::read.dti.trk(..., coords = 'ras') applies it and returns RAS+ mm coordinates in MNI152 space. The MNI152 space differs from the fsaverage-like space of the fs_LR_32 and fsaverage template surfaces of fsbrain by a few mm, so the overlay is visually correct but not exact.",
